    "attribution_redact": "The link records who acted but does not by itself make the row that person's Brain data; erase the identifier without deleting another subject's row.",
    "cascade_workspace_scope": "The child follows a workspace only after that exact workspace is independently authorised for deletion.",
    "cascade_parent_scope": "The child follows its classified parent and must never be selected independently from that parent scope.",
    "owner_scope_unresolved": "Deleting an operator or owner must not silently delete a different person's Brain; transfer, closure and orphan policy is unresolved.",
